    {
     "text": "That's where his chapter title comes from. Faced with all this care, he sarcastically cries out: govern me harder, daddy."
    },
    {
     "text": "Defenders say many such rules follow real accidents, and that Quebec's language laws protect a minority language on an English-speaking continent."
