   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Ants are remarkable. But humans aren't ants. We're individuals who cooperate, compete, and want our effort to count."
    },
    {
     "text": "The challenge, for left and right alike, is building a society that's kind without asking people to stop being human."
    },
    {
     "text": "That ends our tour through Suicidal Empathy. Agree with Saad or not, his question is worth keeping: is our kindness actually helping?"
